{"unit_id":"derekhu0002__archgraph#feature-1","repo":"derekhu0002/archgraph","commit":"12a14aa3933b5e81b34c4f911cb975ec6a9b33bd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArchGraph 的功能「MCP 工具桥接」：在 DSH 加载时连接本地 ARGO MCP 服务和配置的远程 Graph MCP 服务，并把列出的工具注册到工具列表；调用结果以文本内容返回。 通过 DSH 工具调用或会话启动自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-argo-workspace/index.js:138-166"]}
{"unit_id":"derekhu0002__archgraph#feature-2","repo":"derekhu0002/archgraph","commit":"12a14aa3933b5e81b34c4f911cb975ec6a9b33bd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArchGraph 的功能「会话工作区传递」：调用 ARGO 工具时从当前会话读取工作区目录，并将其作为 workspaceRoot 传给服务端，使工具按当前会话工作区处理请求。 通过 DSH 工具调用或会话启动自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-argo-workspace/index.js:203-225"]}
{"unit_id":"derekhu0002__archgraph#feature-3","repo":"derekhu0002/archgraph","commit":"12a14aa3933b5e81b34c4f911cb975ec6a9b33bd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArchGraph 的功能「启动记忆提示」：在 system prompt 中加入会话启动指引，要求 agent 查询图谱 schema、恢复工作记忆并按需检索长期记忆。 通过 DSH 工具调用或会话启动自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-argo-wakeup/index.js:11-16"]}
{"unit_id":"derekhu0002__archgraph#feature-4","repo":"derekhu0002/archgraph","commit":"12a14aa3933b5e81b34c4f911cb975ec6a9b33bd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArchGraph 的功能「远程图谱连接」：通过 graph-mcp stdio bridge 把远程 Graph MCP 端点配置为一个工具服务器，供 DSH 挂载其 MCP 工具。 通过 DSH 工具调用或会话启动自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-13","argo/mcp-bridges/graph-mcp-stdio.js:14-19"]}
